@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folders/{folder_uuid}
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nFOLDER + USER_FOLDER_BINDING" as DB
queue "交易 outbox" as OUT
queue "标式化投影任务" as TASK
participant "沃克人游泳池" as WORKER
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENT
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISP
participant "签名客户端" as WS
Client -> API: PUT JSON 文件
note right of API
  系统规则/类型不能手动更改.
  自动 FOLDER_ITEM: 活跃的 USER_STREAM_BINDING + 规范性 STREAM.is_archived = false.
  All chats = 所有的; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false.
end note
API -> DB: BEGIN; 在指定区域中锁定文件
API -> DB: 更新正规的 FOLDER
API -> OUT: 添加 folder.updated
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 200 JSON 文件
OUT -> TASK: immutable folder_projection(outbox_event_uuid)\nscope=user-folder; 没有 coalescing
TASK -> WORKER: claim user-folder(project,user,folder)\nlease + fencing
WORKER -> DB: 阅读 ready snapshot/counts
group 一个 worker DB transaction
  WORKER -> DB: preserve ready snapshot/counts; idempotent effect guard
  WORKER -> EVENT: ready folder.updated
end
DISP -> EVENT: 阅读/重复/播放
DISP -> WS: folder.updated
@enduml
